# Batch 05: numeric FP: error / range / crit / integrate / dsolve (fast-math sensitive).
r1(x: f32 in 0..1) = sqrt(x)
r2(x: f32 in 0..1) = x*x
error r1 ~ r2
g(x: f32 in -1..1) = sin(x)
h(x: f32 in -1..1) = x - x^3/6 + x^5/120
error h ~ g
range g
crit g
crit h
f(x: f64 in 0..1) = exp(x)
range f
crit f
integrate sin(x) from 0 to pi
integrate exp(-x^2) from 0 to 3
integrate 1/(1+x^4) from 0 to 1
integrate sqrt(1-x^2) from -1 to 1
y' = -2y + 1
y(0) = 3
dsolve y to 2 steps 8
z' = z*(1-z)
z(0) = 0.1
dsolve z to 2 steps 8
u'' = -u
u(0) = 1
u'(0) = 0
dsolve u to 6.283185307 steps 8
